 calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Cuming County runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 29% of normal in January to February and 206% in June to July. In 2026 so far, the middle shows January to February at 34% and February to March at 46%. Grid 26533 had its driest year in 2022 at 53% of normal.</p>"}
